OL,3,GNEWSALabour reclaims seat in Walkley
OL,4,Aby-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour has won back a council seat in
OL,7,FWalkley after a by-election triggered
OL,8,Fby the resignation of a Green Party
OL,9,Fcouncillor.
OL,11,FHannah Cawley was elected after
OL,12,Fsecuring 2,315 votes, while the Green's
OL,13,Fcandidate, Seb Van Bilsen Irias, came
OL,14,Fsecond with 1,249.
OL,16,FWriting on social media, Cawley said
OL,17,Fshe was "extremely happy" with the
OL,18,Fresult.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
