OL,3,GNEWSALabour reclaims seat in Walkley
OL,4,Aby-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe by-election was called after Andy
OL,7,FDavies, who won the seat from Labour's
OL,8,Fthen-council leader Tom Hunt in May,
OL,9,Fresigned for mental health reasons.
